<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria places 9.7 bln levs 4-week T-bills.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria places 9.7 bln levs 4-week T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry placed 9.654 billion lev worth of four-week discount T-bills, yielding 15.97 percent to maturity, the Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) said on Friday.</p>
<p>In line with its usual practice the BNB did not say with which financial instituion or institutions the issue was placed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow. Priced percent of par.</p>
<p> Issue number		   BG 3011497008</p>
<p> Par value			9.654 bln levs</p>
<p> Issue date		     January 15, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date		  February 12, 1997</p>
<p> Selling price		  86.23 pct</p>
<p> Yield to maturity	    15.97 pct</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
